// @check
// @error non-exhaustive match — an integer `match` needs a `_` arm
// THE WILDCARD IS MANDATORY over an integer scrutinee (D1572). An `i32` has 2^32 values and no
// closed member SET, so there is no arm list that could stand in for a `_` the way naming every
// member of a union does — exhaustiveness IS the wildcard here, and a match without one is a
// hard error rather than a silently-void fall-through.
//
// ONE diagnostic, deliberately: the missing arm is the root cause and nothing downstream is
// re-reported, which is why this asserts the whole error stream rather than a substring of it.

function rank(x: i32): i32 {
  match x {
    1 => 10
    2 => 20
  }
}

print(rank(1))
